---
title: "Sequence 3: Failure, watchdog and retry"
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User
  participant UI as Web UI (React)
  participant API as API server + Watchdog
  participant W as Worker process
  participant DB as SQLite + logs
  API->>W: start job (separate process)
  loop every 1 s
    API->>W: check RSS, CPU, step time
  end
  alt over RAM limit or step timeout
    API->>W: terminate, then kill
    API->>DB: span error, job failed, ERROR log
  else worker error (e.g. FFmpeg exit 1)
    W->>DB: span error + stderr, job failed
  end
  API->>API: respawn fresh worker
  API-->>UI: SSE failed {step, reason}
  UI-->>U: Failed at step, View trace / Retry
  opt View trace
    UI->>API: GET /trace + /logs?job=id
    API-->>UI: spans + log lines
  end
  U->>UI: Retry
  UI->>API: POST /api/jobs/{id}/retry
  API->>W: re-run from failed step, cuts kept
